    "description": "Title\n: MENS ACCESSORIES LOT INC THE PROFESSIONAL WINE OPENER& BOOTS HATS PENS COMIC LOT\nBrand\n: Mixed Brands\nModel\n: Mixed Models\nColor\n: Black, Multicolor\nDepartment\n: Men\nCategory\n: Clothing, Shoes & Accessories\nSLIPPER SHOE SIZE: M10-W12\nBOOTS MEASUREMENTS: 12\" INCHES LENGTH\nMAY HAVE WEAR & TEAR SCRATCHES/DENTS/DINGS\nDescription\n: This versatile Men's Accessories Bundle brings together style, function, and fun. Included are two pairs of rugged bootsone tactical-style in black and one leather with visible wearideal for everyday or outdoor needs. You'll find a pair of new OOFOs black slide sandals with tag, and two hats: a Bud Light NFL mesh trucker cap and a sleek black cap with metallic Jumpman emblem. The bundle also features a Stanley travel mug, a professional wine opener set, and a Charred Edge cocktail smoker kit (box sealed). For practical details, there's a boxed Waterman Paris pen set and a folding knife with dog/hunter motif. A cigar kit with accessories and a Perdomo cigar cutter are boxed for easy gifting. Rounding out the lot, a large assortment of comic books offers entertainment value. Items show varying degrees of use, with some new and others gently worn, but all are ready for new owners. Perfect for collectors or anyone seeking a mix of men's essentials and unique extras\nDezavala\nNotes\nLOCAL PICK-UP IS NOW AVAILABLE.\nPLEASE CONTACT CUSTOMER SERVICE TO SCHEDULE AN APPOINTMENT. YOU MUST MAKE AN APPOINTMENT FOR LOCAL PICK-UP ITEMS. LOCAL PICK-UP IS AVAILABLE MONDAY-FRIDAY 8am-4pm CST\nIF YOU HAVE ANY QUESTIONS PLEASE CONTACT OUR\nCUSTOMER SERVICE DEPARTMENT AT\n(726) 237-7616\nOR CLICK ON THE CUSTOMER SERVICE TAB IN SHOPGOODWILL.COM\nUsed Items Disclaimer\nThis is a pre-owned item and is being sold “AS IS ” If you have any questions concerning this item, feel free to contact us\nAll items (including new) are donated and may pick up dust/debris from warehouse – wash/clean before you wear/use\nWe describe our items to the best of our ability and try to incorporate as much research as possible with books and internet\nHowever, we are NOT experts in any field\nAll measurements for items are approximated\nGoodwill helps change lives\nthrough the power of work!\nThanks for shopping\nGoodwill Industries Of San Antonio!\nTerms of Sale\nOrders must be paid for within ten (10) days from the close of auction, unless other arrangements have been agreed upon.  All orders not paid within ten (10) days from the close of auction will be resold without further notice.",
